    "group": "Doom Scythe",
    "summary": "When the Doom Scythe picks a target for the heavy death ray, the enemy player chooses one outcome. The target can stand firm. Or it can duck for cover. Against a unit that stands firm, the ray scores Critical Hits on unmodified rolls to Hit of 5+. If the unit ducks, its models take −1 on their Hit rolls. That penalty expires as your next Shooting phase starts.",
